# Conformance probe pack for presence bits under `bit_order msb-lsb` (spec
# 0.22, ruling 2: presence bits keep their reading-order numbering). Public. Bit order msb-lsb (spec 0.22): positions count from the high bit of
# each byte, a value is assembled from its first bit up. No
# kinds.
#
#   2 bits        presence p: p.1 is the first bit read
#   if p.1        x, 6 bits
#   if p.2        y, 8 bits
format     conformance-long-mlsb-presence
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb-lsb
presence p 2
if p.1
  field  probe.x  6  uint
end
if p.2
  field  probe.y  8  uint
end
